  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MIC 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But in the last days it shall come to pass,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mountain of the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be established in the top of the mountains, and it shall be exalted above the hills; and people shall flow unto it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And many nations shall come, and say, Come, and let us go up to the mountain of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and to the house of the God of Jacob; and he will teach us of his ways, and we will walk in his paths: for the law shall go forth of Zion, and the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he shall judge among many people, and rebuke strong nations afar off; and they shall beat their swords into plowshares, and their spears into pruninghooks: nation shall not lift up a sword against nation, neither shall they learn war any more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they shall sit every man under his vine and under his fig tree; and none shall make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afraid: for the mouth of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts hath spoken",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For all people will walk every one in the name of his god, and we will walk in the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", will I assemble her that halteth, and I will gather her that is driven out, and her that I have afflicted;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make her that halted a remnant, and her that was cast far off a strong nation: and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall reign over them in mount Zion from henceforth, even for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And thou, O tower of the flock, the strong hold of the daughter of Zion, unto thee shall it come, even the first dominion; the kingdom shall come to the daughter of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now why dost thou cry out aloud?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no king in thee? is thy counsellor perished? for pangs have taken thee as a woman in travail.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be in pain, and labour to bring forth, O daughter of Zion, like a woman in travail: for now shalt thou go forth out of the city, and thou shalt dwell in the field, and thou shalt go",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Babylon; there shalt thou be delivered; there the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall redeem thee from the hand of thine enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Now also many nations are gathered against thee, that say, Let her be defiled, and let our eye look upon Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they know not the thoughts of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", neither understand they his counsel: for he shall gather them as the sheaves into the floor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise and thresh, O daughter of Zion: for I will make thine horn iron, and I will make thy hoofs brass: and thou shalt beat in pieces many people: and I will consecrate their gain unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MIC.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MIC.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and their substance unto the Lord of the whole earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "MIC.5",
